B.a08=new A.aQ(B.yU,["Merhaba m\xfchendis!","Merhaba {n}!","H\u0131zl\u0131 ba\u015fla","G\xf6r\xfcn\xfcm","Sistem","Ayd\u0131nl\u0131k","Gece","Bilim insanlar\u0131","Di\u015fli biriktir, \xfcnl\xfc bilim insanlar\u0131n\u0131 tak\u0131m\u0131na kat. Se\xe7ti\u011fin isim soru \xe7\xf6zerken sana e\u015flik eder.","Tak\u0131m\u0131na kat\u0131ld\u0131:","Tak\u0131m lideri","M\xfchendisli\u011fi oyna, form\xfclleri ya\u015fa.","Dersler","Ba\u015fla","G\xfcnl\xfck hedef","{n} yeni soru a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131!","{x} tak\u0131ma kat\u0131l\u0131nca a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r","Zorluk","{n} soru","Terim kart\u0131","Hesap makinesi","Cevaba yaz","M\xfchendis hesap makinesi","D\xf6rt i\u015flem, \xfcs, k\xf6k, \u03c0, parantez, trigonometri (derece), log ve ln. 2\u03c0 veya 3(4+1) gibi gizli \xe7arp\u0131m\u0131 da anlar.","Basit","Kolay","Orta","Orta-\xfcst","Zor","Zor-\xfcst","\xc7ok zor","\xc7\xf6z","Ad\u0131m ad\u0131m nas\u0131l kullan\u0131l\u0131r?","Hangi s\xfcrt\xfcnme form\xfcl\xfc?","S\u0131k yap\u0131lan hata","Sorular nerede \xe7\u0131kar?","Tak\u0131m\u0131na katt\u0131\u011f\u0131n her bilim insan\u0131 46 soruluk bir paket a\xe7ar. Bu sorular \u015furalarda kar\u015f\u0131na \xe7\u0131kar:\n\n\u2022 Kart\u0131n \xfczerindeki \u25b6 \xc7\xf6z d\xfc\u011fmesi: o paketten 10 soru\n\u2022 Oyna \u203a G\xfcnl\xfck sorular: a\xe7\u0131k paketlerden en az g\xf6rd\xfc\u011f\xfcn 5 soru\n\u2022 Oyna \u203a Robot d\xfcellosu: a\xe7\u0131k paketlerden \xe7oktan se\xe7meli sorular\n\u2022 Oyna \u203a G\xf6revler: hik\xe2yeli sorular (kilitliler \ud83d\udd12 ile g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr)\n\u2022 \xd6\u011fren \u203a M\xfcfredat \u203a bir \xfcnite \u203a form\xfcl \u203a Bu konuda soru \xe7\xf6z\n\nZorluk: Ar\u015fimet basit, Pascal kolay, Torricelli orta, Newton orta-\xfcst, Bernoulli zor, Euler zor-\xfcst (yakla\u015f\u0131m sorular\u0131), Reynolds \xe7ok zor.\n\nForm\xfcl say\u0131s\u0131: Ar\u015fimet ve Pascal sorular\u0131 tek form\xfclle, Torricelli ve Newton 2\u20133 form\xfclle, Bernoulli, Euler ve Reynolds sorular\u0131 4 form\xfclle \xe7\xf6z\xfcl\xfcr. Zor sorular 2\u20133 konuyu birle\u015ftirir (\ud83e\udde9 kompozit).\n\nAra\xe7lar \u203a Diyagramlar: Moody, pompa e\u011frisi ve viskozite diyagramlar\u0131yla soru \xe7\xf6z.","Diyagramlar","Moody, pompa e\u011frisi, viskozite ve ak\u0131\u015f rejimi. Sorular\u0131 grafikle \xe7\xf6z.","M\xfchendislerin her g\xfcn bakt\u0131\u011f\u0131 grafikler. Parma\u011f\u0131n\u0131 grafi\u011fin \xfczerinde kayd\u0131r, de\u011feri oku.","{n} soru","{n} form\xfcl","Kompozit","Form\xfcl zinciri","Diyagram sorusu","\ud83d\udcdd Bu diyagramla soru \xe7\xf6z ({n})","Nas\u0131l okunur?","Grafi\u011fe dokun ya da parma\u011f\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011fa-sola kayd\u0131r.","\ud83d\udcc8 Diyagram\u0131 a\xe7","Ba\u011f\u0131l p\xfcr\xfczl\xfcl\xfck \u03b5/D","p\xfcr\xfczs\xfcz","Colebrook ile kontrol et","Pompa e\u011frisi","Sistem e\u011frisi","\xc7al\u0131\u015fma noktas\u0131","Vana a\xe7\u0131kl\u0131\u011f\u0131","Vanay\u0131 k\u0131st\u0131k\xe7a sistem e\u011frisi dikle\u015fir; \xe7al\u0131\u015fma noktas\u0131 sola kayar: debi azal\u0131r, basma y\xfcksekli\u011fi artar.","su","hava","Moody Diyagram\u0131","S\xfcrt\xfcnme fakt\xf6r\xfc f; Reynolds say\u0131s\u0131 ve ba\u011f\u0131l p\xfcr\xfczl\xfcl\xfc\u011fe (\u03b5/D) g\xf6re.","Re = V\xb7D/\u03bd ile Reynolds say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 hesapla ve yatay eksende bul.","Borunun malzemesinden \u03b5\u2019yi al (\xf6r. d\xf6kme demir 0,26 mm), \u03b5/D oran\u0131n\u0131 hesapla ve o e\u011friyi se\xe7.","Re < 2300 ise e\u011fri de\u011fil, soldaki d\xfcz laminer \xe7izgi (f = 64/Re) ge\xe7erlidir.","E\u011fri ile Re\u2019nin kesi\u015fti\u011fi noktadan sola bak\u0131p f\u2019yi oku, sonra Darcy\u2013Weisbach\u2019ta kullan.","Pompa ve Sistem E\u011frisi","Pompa ne kadar basabilir, sistem ne kadar ister? Kesi\u015ftikleri nokta \xe7al\u0131\u015fma noktas\u0131d\u0131r.","Pompa e\u011frisi (turuncu): debi artt\u0131k\xe7a pompan\u0131n verdi\u011fi basma y\xfcksekli\u011fi d\xfc\u015fer.","Sistem e\u011frisi (mavi): statik y\xfckseklik + debinin karesiyle artan s\xfcrt\xfcnme kay\u0131plar\u0131.","\u0130ki e\u011frinin kesi\u015fti\u011fi nokta pompan\u0131n ger\xe7ekte \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131 debi ve y\xfcksekliktir.","G\xfcc\xfc bulmak i\xe7in kesi\u015fimdeki Q ve H de\u011ferlerini P = \u03c1\xb7g\xb7Q\xb7H/\u03b7 form\xfcl\xfcne koy.","Viskozite \u2013 S\u0131cakl\u0131k","Suyun ve havan\u0131n kinematik viskozitesi s\u0131cakl\u0131kla nas\u0131l de\u011fi\u015fir?","Yatay eksende s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 bul.","Mavi e\u011fri suyun \u03bd de\u011feri (sol eksen), turuncu e\u011fri havan\u0131n \u03bd de\u011feri (sa\u011f eksen).","Okudu\u011fun de\u011fer mm\xb2/s cinsindendir: m\xb2/s i\xe7in 10\u207b\u2076 ile \xe7arp.","Bu \u03bd ile Re = V\xb7D/\u03bd hesaplay\u0131p ak\u0131\u015f rejimini belirle.","Ak\u0131\u015f Rejimi \u015eemas\u0131","Re de\u011ferine g\xf6re hangi s\xfcrt\xfcnme form\xfcl\xfcn\xfc kullanaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6sterir.","Re < 2300: laminer \u2192 f = 64/Re.","2300 \u2013 4000: ge\xe7i\u015f b\xf6lgesi, tasar\u0131mda ka\xe7\u0131n\u0131l\u0131r.","Re > 4000, p\xfcr\xfczs\xfcz boru: Blasius. P\xfcr\xfczl\xfc boru: Moody diyagram\u0131.","M\xfcfredat","Ak\u0131\u015fkanlar Mekani\u011fi dersinin 12 \xfcnitesi ve {n} form\xfcl\xfc. Bir \xfcniteye dokun, form\xfcllerini a\xe7.","\xdcnite {n}","{f} form\xfcl \xb7 {q} soru","Notlar\u0131m","Yeni not","Not","Notlara d\xf6n","Kapat","Sil","Form\xfclleri, ipu\xe7lar\u0131n\u0131 ya da \xe7\xf6z\xfcm ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 buraya not al. Her sayfadan ula\u015fabilirsin.","Notunu yaz\u2026 \u0130lk sat\u0131r ba\u015fl\u0131k olur.","Otomatik kaydedildi","Not silindi","Geri al","Ba\u015fl\u0131ks\u0131z not","Bug\xfcn","M\xfchendisli\u011fi oynayarak \xf6\u011fren","Bas\u0131n\xe7 \xf6l\xe7\xfcl\xfcyor","Debi hesaplan\u0131yor","Reynolds kontrol ediliyor","Bernoulli haz\u0131r","Ge\xe7mek i\xe7in dokun","Hesab\u0131n\u0131 olu\u015ftur","S\u0131ralamada ad\u0131nla yer al. Bilgilerin yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda saklan\u0131r.","Ad","Soyad","E-posta","Ba\u015fla","Ad\u0131n\u0131 yaz.","Soyad\u0131n\u0131 yaz.","Ge\xe7erli bir e-posta adresi yaz (\xf6r. ad@okul.edu.tr).","Telefon (iste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131)","Ge\xe7erli bir telefon numaras\u0131 yaz (\xf6r. 0532 123 45 67) ya da bo\u015f b\u0131rak.","Ho\u015f geldin, {n}! \ud83c\udf93","S\u0131ralamada ad\u0131nla yar\u0131\u015f","\u0130lerlemen kaydedilir","Notlar\u0131n ve rozetlerin seninle","Hesab\u0131m","\xc7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yap","\xc7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yap\u0131ls\u0131n m\u0131? \u0130lerlemen bu cihazda kal\u0131r; tekrar giri\u015f yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131nda devam edersin.","Bilgileri d\xfczenle","Kaydet","Vazge\xe7","S\u0131nav Haz\u0131rl\u0131k","\xdcniversite vize ve finallerinde \xe7\u0131kan t\xfcrde, \xe7ok a\u015famal\u0131 problemler. Her s\u0131nav 4 problemden olu\u015fur.","Vize Sorular\u0131","Final Sorular\u0131","Ak\u0131\u015fkan \xf6zellikleri, statik, kald\u0131rma, rijit cisim, Bernoulli, enerji ve momentum.","Boyut analizi, boru ak\u0131\u015f\u0131, pompalar, kavitasyon, d\u0131\u015f ak\u0131\u015f, a\xe7\u0131k kanal ve s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131labilir ak\u0131\u015f.","{n}. Vize","{n}. Final","4 problem \xb7 {p} a\u015fama","En iyi: %{n}","Yeni","Reklam izle ve gir","Bug\xfcnk\xfc s\u0131nav reklam hakk\u0131: {n}/15","Bug\xfcnl\xfck s\u0131nav reklam hakk\u0131n bitti. Yar\u0131n yeniden gel!","S\u0131nava gir","{e} i\xe7in k\u0131sa bir reklam izlemen gerekiyor. Reklamdan sonra 4 problemlik s\u0131nav a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r.","\u25b6 Reklam izle","Problemler","S\u0131nava ba\u015fla","\u0130pucu: Her problemin (a), (b), (c) a\u015famalar\u0131 s\u0131rayla gelir; bir a\u015faman\u0131n sonucu sonrakinde kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Hesap makinesi ve ipu\xe7lar\u0131 a\xe7\u0131k.","Soru {p} ({x})","{n} a\u015fama","\xd6nerilen s\xfcre: {n} dk","Vize ve finallere haz\u0131rlan","10 deneme s\u0131nav\u0131 \xb7 \xe7ok a\u015famal\u0131 problemler","Ak\u0131\u015fkanlar ve Termodinamik haz\u0131r; di\u011fer dersler yolda.","\u015eimdilik ge\xe7","\u0130stedi\u011fin zaman Profil\u2019den profilini olu\u015fturabilirsin.","Profil olu\u015ftur","S\u0131ralamada ad\u0131nla yer al, rozetlerin ve ilerlemen sana ait olsun.","Birka\xe7 bilgi yeter. Hepsi yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda saklan\u0131r, hi\xe7bir yere g\xf6nderilmez.","Bilgilerini g\xfcncelle. Hepsi yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda saklan\u0131r.","S\u0131ralama","Rozetler","\u0130lerleme","Profilimi olu\u015ftur","Not defteri","Notlar\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7; gizlediysen yeniden g\xf6sterir.","Not defterini gizle","Not defteri gizlendi. Soru ekran\u0131ndaki \u201cNot defteri\u201d d\xfc\u011fmesiyle geri a\xe7abilirsin.","Bug\xfcn\xfcn g\xf6revi","Bug\xfcnk\xfc 5 soruya ba\u015fla","Devam et","Hedef tamam! \u0130stersen prati\u011fe devam et.","\u0130lk sorular\u0131n\u0131 \xe7\xf6z; seri, do\u011fruluk ve seviye burada g\xf6r\xfcnecek.","Arka plan animasyonu","Sayfalar\u0131n arkas\u0131nda kayan form\xfcller","+{n} XP"],t.l)
